#### three-input-sub — C3/B1: SUB takes 2 inputs (the build refuses a third)
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION FBD
NETWORK
  i := j SUB k SUB m;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED SUB takes 2 inputs

